# The original upload archive is kept on disk as a rollback reference.
# It is intentionally not tracked by git.
magadh_netlify.zip

# The 17 full-resolution source photographs (approx. 150MB). Kept on disk as the
# provenance record; the rotation-corrected web derivatives under
# assets/images/tiles/ are the tracked versions actually served to visitors.
assets/images/visual/*
!assets/images/visual/Bathroom Solution.png
!assets/images/visual/Bathroom Solution-1200.webp
!assets/images/visual/Exxaro-2.jpg
!assets/images/visual/Installtion.png
!assets/images/visual/Installtion-1200.webp
!assets/images/visual/logo-crystal.png
!assets/images/visual/surface materials.png
!assets/images/visual/surface materials-1200.webp
!assets/images/visual/vura.jpg
!assets/images/visual/vura-700.webp

# Second, larger full-resolution upload drop (19 original "Tiles- (N).jpg" files,
# approx. 167MB). Same reasoning as above: on-disk archive only. The tracked
# 900x1350 derivatives under assets/images/tiles/collection/ are what visitors get.
assets/images/original/

